------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Why GPL, and why this is a SEPARATE project from negaflow
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This plugin drives SANE (Scanner Access Now Easy). SANE backends used by film
scanners are distributed under GPL-2.0-or-later. All SANE-specific discovery,
option handling, process control, and tests live in this separately distributed
program. negaflow communicates with it through a separate OS process and a
versioned JSON/NDJSON protocol; negaflow does not link or bundle this executable.
These are architectural facts, not a legal conclusion about every possible
distribution. See PROVENANCE.md for the audited boundary.

The full text of the GNU General Public License, version 2, should be
distributed alongside this software as the file COPYING. It is available at
https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.txt
